  m_text: "Task Goal \nYou will teach the avatar how to solve the following problem.\n\nThe
    U.S. Postal Service is facing significant challenges:\n- Rising Compensation:
    Postal workers' wages consistently increase due to cost-of-living adjustments,
    affecting operational costs.\n- Digital Shift: More people are switching from
    traditional mail (\"snail mail\") to digital forms fo communication such as email,
    text, Facebook, and Twitter.\n\nQuestion: What are the effects on the quantitiy
    of postal services demanded and the price of postal services, and why?"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
